		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		background: linear-gradient(
			180deg, 
			rgba(4, 5, 7, 0.82) 0%, 
			rgba(4, 5, 7, 0.15) 30%, 
			rgba(4, 5, 7, 0.25) 55%, 
